    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-27",
      "author": "guest-6f9f9ffd47a5b90d",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T14:04:54.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-26",
      "likes": 5,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "guest": {
        "name": "拐个弯"
      },
      "text": "我小姨这会儿又在发相亲照片。介绍工作可以，这个真不用了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-26",
      "author": "visitor-delta-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T14:03:38.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-25",
      "likes": 11,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "你到底说她什么了？光看这句我没懂。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-25",
      "author": "visitor-theta-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T14:02:27.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-23",
      "likes": 1,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "我说她没画了吗？你也挺会补的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-24",
      "author": "guest-6f9f9ffd47a5b90d",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T14:00:45.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-23",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "guest": {
        "name": "拐个弯"
      },
      "text": "我现在的活就是亲戚介绍的，也没谁替我上班啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-23",
      "author": "visitor-upsilon-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T13:44:13.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-22",
      "likes": 5,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "接到什么项目，和图是不是自己做的，能算同一件事吗？有叔叔就一笔都不用自己画了？"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-22",
      "author": "visitor-theta-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T13:34:06.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-21",
      "likes": 5,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "图我不贴了，有她名字。我都说了图是好看的，哪句说她画得不好了？问纸是因为那种浅紫印出来容易灰，问一句也不至于是什么机密吧。你刚还说想看作品，转头就跟着笑，到底想看图还是想看我急啊？"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-21",
      "author": "guest-543b2df0f966a0e4",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T13:28:52.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-18",
      "likes": 12,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [
        {
          "src": "assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp",
          "alt": "L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。",
          "fit": "contain"
        }
      ],
      "guest": {
        "name": "剪刀找不到"
      },
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-20",
      "author": "guest-543b2df0f966a0e4",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T13:28:25.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-19",
      "likes": 7,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [
        {
          "src": "assets/emotes/l0/wait.webp",
          "alt": "L0蹲着，双手托住脸，尾巴向一侧弯起。",
          "fit": "contain"
        }
      ],
      "guest": {
        "name": "剪刀找不到"
      },
      "text": "图呢，我想看那个作品"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-19",
      "author": "guest-c6990ce4e6399e47",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T13:27:52.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-18",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "guest": {
        "name": "断网十分钟"
      },
      "text": "那评论不能是发的人自己删的？你怎么知道谁动的手。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-18",
      "author": "visitor-theta-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T13:26:35.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-17",
      "likes": 9,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "你笑什么啊？"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-17",
      "author": "guest-0e8dc9736409183c",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T13:24:13.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-16",
      "likes": 8,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [
        {
          "src": "assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp",
          "alt": "L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。",
          "fit": "contain"
        }
      ],
      "guest": {
        "name": "番茄去皮"
      },
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-16",
      "author": "visitor-theta-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T13:22:57.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-15",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "她那个浅紫色我还存了。我昨天问她用的什么纸，到现在没回，朋友圈倒是又更了两条。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-15",
      "author": "guest-0e8dc9736409183c",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T13:11:50.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05",
      "likes": 8,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "guest": {
        "name": "番茄去皮"
      },
      "text": "终于靠自己喊了声叔叔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-14",
      "author": "visitor-psi",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T09:34:39.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-13",
      "likes": 10,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [
        {
          "src": "assets/emotes/l0/melon.webp",
          "alt": "L0扒着边沿，双手拿一片西瓜。",
          "fit": "contain"
        }
      ],
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-13",
      "author": "guyu",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T09:28:07.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-12",
      "likes": 1,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "那你这句算不算也在管别人？"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-12",
      "author": "visitor-latebell",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T08:33:11.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-11",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "这都能管到口气上"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-11",
      "author": "visitor-nu",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T08:31:44.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-10",
      "likes": 3,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "你自己都叫不上，还先凶别人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-10",
      "author": "guest-22ef89f6b2fe9221",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T06:06:29.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-09",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "guest": {
        "name": "小陶盆"
      },
      "text": "我那盆倒是有名字，卖花的和识图软件各说一个。现在谁问我都只敢说是绿的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-09",
      "author": "guest-fec6b3d78d0a2be0",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T06:05:14.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-08",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [
        {
          "src": "assets/emotes/l0/guilty.webp",
          "alt": "L0缩着肩膀，双手抓着衣领，眼睛看向一侧。",
          "fit": "contain"
        }
      ],
      "guest": {
        "name": "小绿活着就行"
      },
      "text": "我连自己那盆叫什么都不知道"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-08",
      "author": "guest-22ef89f6b2fe9221",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T06:03:18.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "guest": {
        "name": "小陶盆"
      },
      "text": "连是什么植物都不说，这谁敢答啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-07",
      "author": "visitor-omicron",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T02:32:39.467Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-02",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "手机还想过你脸这一关"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-06",
      "author": "visitor-epsilon",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T02:31:38.467Z",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 1,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "有些少儿书的腰封比正文还吵，翻两页全是“你就是最棒的”。推荐的人只说孩子爱看，我也没法接。爱看和写得好，总不能是一回事吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05",
      "author": "visitor-theta-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T02:15:36.467Z",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 19,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "同学发了个“终于靠自己”的作品，下面有人问是不是她叔叔那边的项目，过一会儿那条评论就没了。\n是我想多了吗？（图确实漂亮，但也不用把自己写得那么惨吧）"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04",
      "author": "visitor-epsilon",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T00:48:16.467Z",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 17,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "顺便问一句，花盆转了方向，原来歪掉的茎也会慢慢直回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-03",
      "author": "guest-4881a4db9a0a8f5a",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T00:46:55.467Z",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [
        {
          "src": "assets/emotes/l0/sweat.webp",
          "alt": "L0额头挂着一大滴汗，嘴角翘起。",
          "fit": "contain"
        }
      ],
      "guest": {
        "name": "下午再说"
      },
      "text": "说帮忙改两行，发过来六页，真有你的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-02",
      "author": "visitor-epsilon",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T00:28:57.467Z",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 12,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "过关了，手机差点掉在脸上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261110000207-6a257638-01",
      "author": "chenanjing",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T00:04:12.467Z",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 9,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "这纸的样图是不是加了灰。收到的白得刺眼，铺在桌上像一块灯。\n店家说是我屏幕的问题。"
    },
